      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAN ON FIRE (1) was a strong course and distance winner last time, claiming a Grade 5 in a sharp 18.92 and a new PB here. Should be in this for a long way. SELECT AIRLEY (8) got around the 300m at this track to take a Grade 5 in a good 16.58 for a 2.25 lengths success. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. ETHAN'S BROTHER (3) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (30.30) last time in a Grade 5 at Q Parklands. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Can do much better this time. WARREGO RAIN (7) saluted last start after racing on the speed. That form reads well.",
